  Expected.[ Variant Struct Vector Text Meaning Integer Decimal Boolean Word ]
  Found.[ Variant Struct Vector Text Meaning Word Angled Qualified Chain ]
  Problem.[ Shape.{ Expected Found } Arity.{ Integer Integer } UnknownVariant.Word Value.Opaque Formless.Found OneValue.Integer Exhausted BudgetExhausted ]
  Locus.{ Path Extent }
  Fault.[ Structural.StructuralFault Conceptual.{ Locus Problem } Corporate.{ Locus Problem } ] ]
